---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Approach | History & Leadership | Velokhaya Life Cycling Academy"
  description="Founded in Khayelitsha in 2003, Velokhaya has grown through consistency, commitment, and clear standards. Our work is defined by structured training and shared expectations."
  canonicalPath="/our-approach/"
  ogImage="/images/team-group.jpg"
>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="pt-40 pb-20 bg-brand-dark relative overflow-hidden" style="padding-top: 10rem;">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-gradient-to-l from-brand-red/5 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black mb-6">OUR <span class="text-brand-red">APPROACH</span></h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-400 max-w-2xl border-l-4 border-brand-red pl-6">
                Founded in Khayelitsha in 2003, Velokhaya has grown through consistency, commitment, and clear standards. Our work is defined by how we operate: structured training, shared expectations, and a long term commitment to development on and off the bike.
            </p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Origin Story -->
    <section class="py-24 bg-brand-black">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
                <div class="order-2 md:order-1">
                    <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border border-white/10 overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="/images/team-group.jpg" alt="Velokhaya cycling team standing together in team kit" loading="lazy"
                            class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-white">THE ORIGIN STORY</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                        Velokhaya was established in 2003 with a clear intention: to create a structured environment where young people could commit to cycling, education, and personal development.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                        What began as a small operation in Khayelitsha grew through consistency and high expectations. From the outset, the emphasis was on discipline, accountability, and progression, both in sport and in learning. Over time, the programme expanded, strengthening its coaching, education, and support structures.
                    </p>
                    <div
                        class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-8 border-l-4 border-brand-yellow pl-6 py-2 bg-brand-dark/50 rounded-r-lg">
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-lg text-white font-medium italic mb-2">"Cycling, education, and discipline work together. One does not exist without the others."</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-brand-yellow uppercase tracking-wider font-bold">— Sipho Mona, General Manager</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-8">
                        <div
                            class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-brand-blue flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold">
                            <i data-lucide="quote" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic">"Velokhaya is defined not by where it started, but by how it works."
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Timeline -->
    <section class="py-24 bg-brand-black border-t border-white/5">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mb-16 text-center">OUR <span
                    class="text-brand-yellow">JOURNEY</span></h2>

            <!-- Simple Timeline Grid -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto">

                <!-- 2003 -->
                <div class="relative group">
                    <div
                        class="bg-brand-dark border border-brand-yellow/20 rounded-2xl p-8 h-full hover:border-brand-yellow/50 transition-all hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-yellow/10">
                        <div class="text-brand-yellow font-black text-4xl mb-4">2003</div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Established</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Velokhaya is formally established in Khayelitsha with a focus on structured cycling development.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-1/2 -right-4 w-8 h-0.5 bg-brand-yellow/30"></div>
                </div>

                <!-- 2015 -->
                <div class="relative group">
                    <div
                        class="bg-brand-dark border border-brand-blue/20 rounded-2xl p-8 h-full hover:border-brand-blue/50 transition-all hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-blue/10">
                        <div class="text-brand-blue font-black text-4xl mb-4">2015</div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Education and Skills</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Launch of the ICT and Life Skills Centre in partnership with MTN.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-1/2 -right-4 w-8 h-0.5 bg-brand-blue/30"></div>
                </div>

                <!-- 2021 -->
                <div class="relative group">
                    <div
                        class="bg-brand-dark border border-brand-red/20 rounded-2xl p-8 h-full hover:border-brand-red/50 transition-all hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-red/10">
                        <div class="text-brand-red font-black text-4xl mb-4">2021</div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Olympic Representation</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Velokhaya alumnus Nicholas Dlamini represents South Africa at the Tokyo Olympic Games.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-1/2 -right-4 w-8 h-0.5 bg-brand-red/30"></div>
                </div>

                <!-- 2026 -->
                <div class="relative group">
                    <div
                        class="bg-brand-dark border border-white/20 rounded-2xl p-8 h-full hover:border-white/50 transition-all hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-white/10">
                        <div class="text-white font-black text-4xl mb-4">2025</div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Facility Development</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Successful campaign to develop an indoor training facility and community spinning hub.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-1/2 -right-4 w-8 h-0.5 bg-white/30"></div>
                </div>

                <!-- 2026 -->
                <div class="relative group">
                    <div
                        class="bg-brand-dark border border-brand-yellow/20 rounded-2xl p-8 h-full hover:border-brand-yellow/50 transition-all hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-yellow/10">
                        <div class="text-brand-yellow font-black text-4xl mb-4">2026</div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Expansion</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Secured land in Alexandra, Johannesburg, for a second Velokhaya facility.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Leadership -->
    <section class="py-24 bg-brand-dark">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center">Leadership</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
                <!-- Card 1 -->
                <div
                    class="bg-brand-black p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-yellow/50 transition-all group">
                    <div class="h-96 bg-gray-800 rounded-xl mb-6 overflow-hidden relative">
                        <img src="/images/team-sipho.png"
                            alt="Sipho Mona, General Manager of Velokhaya Life Cycling Academy" loading="lazy"
                            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Sipho Mona</h3>
                    <p class="text-brand-yellow text-sm font-medium mb-4">General Manager</p>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">A graduate of the academy who rose through the ranks to become
                        a professional cyclist before transitioning to lead Velokhaya. As passionate about producing
                        lawyers and doctors as he is about producing pro cyclists.</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Card 2 -->
                <div
                    class="bg-brand-black p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-red/50 transition-all group">
                    <div class="h-96 bg-gray-800 rounded-xl mb-6 overflow-hidden relative">
                        <img src="/images/team-luthando.jpg" alt="Luthando Kaka, Acting Board Member of Velokhaya"
                            loading="lazy"
                            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Luthando Kaka</h3>
                    <p class="text-brand-red text-sm font-medium mb-4">Board Member & Business Leader</p>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Mail & Guardian Top 200. Professional cyclist turned successful business leader and media professional, now driving Velokhaya's strategic vision.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Hall of Fame -->
    <section class="py-24 bg-brand-black border-t border-white/5">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12">Hall of Fame</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <!-- Nic Dlamini -->
                <div
                    class="p-6 bg-brand-dark rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-yellow transition-all group">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto bg-gray-800 rounded-full mb-4 overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="/images/hof-nic.png" alt="Nicholas Dlamini, Tour de France cyclist and Olympian"
                            class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-lg">Nicholas Dlamini</h3>
                    <p class="text-brand-yellow text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Olympian & Tour de France</p>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">From Capricorn Park to the Tokyo Olympics. The ultimate proof
                        point.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Anita Zenani -->
                <div
                    class="p-6 bg-brand-dark rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-red transition-all group">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto bg-gray-800 rounded-full mb-4 overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="/images/hof-anita.png" alt="Anita Zenani, World #6 ranked BMX rider"
                            class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-lg">Anita Zenani</h3>
                    <p class="text-brand-red text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">World #6 BMX</p>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Shattering stereotypes and ranking 6th in the world for her age
                        group.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Xolisa Makubalo -->
                <div
                    class="p-6 bg-brand-dark rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-blue transition-all group">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto bg-gray-800 rounded-full mb-4 overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="/images/hof-xolisa.jpg" alt="Xolisa Makubalo, Head BMX Coach at Velokhaya"
                            class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-lg">Xolisa Makubalo</h3>
                    <p class="text-brand-blue text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Head BMX Coach</p>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Sports Recreation and Exercise Science graduate. Has coached multiple BMX teams to national victories.</p>
                </div>


            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

</BaseLayout>
